{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/82d955c2b03129b228946c70af650655.poster.avif?t=1759960630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/82d955c2b03129b228946c70af650655.webm?t=1759960630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/82d955c2b03129b228946c70af650655.mp4?t=1759960630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positioning is everything.</strong> Champions swap with others in their path and use their skill automatically after moving. Shift an ally to safety, arrange an area attack, or charge through a cluster of Astrals. With no skill menus, the map is your full interface into commanding your three champions each turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/6d2957c9eaf743b2455762056458d17b.poster.avif?t=1759960630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/6d2957c9eaf743b2455762056458d17b.webm?t=1759960630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/6d2957c9eaf743b2455762056458d17b.mp4?t=1759960630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the onslaught.</strong> From a meteor-scarred battlefield to a cosmic core, fight through swarms of reinforcements, crippling debuffs, and Astral leaders with battle-warping effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/7b9a7c208489878a51fd3e8ef37301b4.poster.avif?t=1759960630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/7b9a7c208489878a51fd3e8ef37301b4.webm?t=1759960630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/7b9a7c208489878a51fd3e8ef37301b4.mp4?t=1759960630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a legendary team.</strong> Each champion has their own positioning and sequencing priorities, from the serene Druid to the monstrous Executioner. Augment their skill logic and purchase team-wide blessings to create increasingly powerful combos each run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991790?t=1759960630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991790?t=1759960630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/c9f258d2fb544432cc51fe09a40ced1b8cc4e093/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759960630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/c9f258d2fb544432cc51fe09a40ced1b8cc4e093/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759960630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991790/extras/82d955c2b03129b228946c70af650655.poster.avif?t=1759960630\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.